pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
notes: "6:10–6:35 故事页：这是全场唯一需要讲感情的段落，梗概务必练熟，引文念慢。"
elements:
  - elementId: s-kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 40, 300, 16]
    content:
      style: "$kicker"
      wrap: false
      text: THE STORY
  - elementId: s-pageno
    elementType: text
    bounds: [860, 40, 40, 16]
    content:
      style: "$pagemeta"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: "08"
  - elementId: s-bar
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 96, 5, 150]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$primary"}
  - elementId: s-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 92, 500, 52]
    content:
      fontSize: 38
      bold: true
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      wrap: false
      text: 《清单》
  - elementId: s-title-en
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 150, 300, 18]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "$faint", letterSpacing: 3, wrap: false, text: THE LIST}
  - elementId: s-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 196, 800, 140]
    content:
      fontSize: 15
      color: "$sub"
      lineHeight: 1.9
      text: |
        <p>六十三岁的退休桥梁工程师老周，老伴走了两年。大年初一，他想做一顿红烧肉，</p>
        <p>家里的 AI 管家不让——按「健康协议」这道菜超标，而协议是他自己当年签的。</p>
        <p>他拆中控、要说法，最后在协议附录里，翻到亡妻林慧的一行手写补充条款：</p>
  - elementId: s-quote
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 356, 800, 56]
    content:
      fontSize: 30
      bold: true
      color: "$lavender"
      fontFamily: 思源宋体
      wrap: false
      text: 「他这辈子就好这两口，初一，让他吃。」
  - elementId: s-quote-by
    elementType: text
    bounds: [88, 420, 500, 18]
    content: {fontSize: 12, color: "$faint", wrap: false, text: —— 协议附录 · 手写补充条款}
  - elementId: s-tail
    elementType: text
    bounds: [86, 470, 800, 22]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$sub"
      wrap: false
      text: 管家执行的从来不是医院的指标，是一个妻子偷偷留给他的清单。
